	(text "VM = VSYS: the pack after F1 and the power switch (up to 12.6 V; DRV8848 VM max 18 V).\nnSLEEP of all three drivers on GPIO23 (DRV_SLEEP); nFAULT wired-OR on GPIO19 (DRV_FAULT, pull-up on the MCU sheet).\nMotor inputs: GPIOn_MxA/B = the GPIO number and motor; A/B of one motor share a PWM slice.\nB motors are wired reversed (OUT1 to BOUT2) as in rev 1: the firmware's direction handling depends on it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
